anguage":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"880045","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"局長からアスクールたちに与えられた特務は、ディアと名乗る少女の｢子守｣。不思議な内容の特務に戸惑う2人だったが、天真爛漫なディアとはすぐに仲良くなった。そこで彼女にGTO本局を案内するのだが……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-06","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6cD9xfw35zqqQqPUlX3xL3wjpiq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6cD9xfw35zqqQqPUlX3xL3wjpiq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"880046","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"いまは閉鎖されているGOTT本局ビルに、なにかが｢出る｣という。アスクールたち3人は調査を命じられるが、廃墟の中で離ればなれになってしまう。そんな3人を見つめる妖しい瞳。はたして本当に｢出る｣のか!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-13","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yh6B5NeWtXsdsTNGNIfpCEHgCMa.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yh6B5NeWtXsdsTNGNIfpCEHgCMa.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"880047","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"イヴェール局長と秘書のゾマが、クリスマスパーティに備えてアヤシ~イ手品の練習!?それはさておき、アリサ行きつけの執事声優カフェに案内されたアスクールたち。BL全開の展開はディアの教育上よろしくない!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-20","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kzRSFdKd047m64DoVsa396qbX0j.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kzRSFdKd047m64DoVsa396qbX0j.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"880048","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ESメンバーの中でもトップの実力を持つトリクシーとトロワジェインの特務に、アスクールたちが同行することになった。違法戦闘艦の密造が行われる要塞で、彼女たちはGソサエティのシャドウワーカー、トーチとシェイドに遭遇する。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gdRofAbnc0dcCOt3JVJPxBhqsiT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gdRofAbnc0dcCOt3JVJPxBhqsiT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"880049","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"GTOが創立25周年記念行事の準備に追われる、ちょうどその頃。Gソサエティの移動要塞エルデ・メテオールでは、総帥ガクトエルによる建国宣言が行われようとしていた。GTOを｢敵｣とする彼らの目的とは――!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tKgqBziYHLOiHv3guJVJx55CH6m.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tKgqBziYHLOiHv3guJVJx55CH6m.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"880050","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"GTO創立25周年を祝う記念式典。その最中に突如、上空にGソサエティ総帥のガクトエルの姿が映し出された。敵特殊能力者シャドウワーカーも襲来する。立ち向かうESメンバー。しかし敵は彼らの能力を研究しつくしており……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-11","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ypqoIL0BEkNi3H12R9v7tSznt6v.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ypqoIL0BEkNi3H12R9v7tSznt6v.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"880051","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"式典での事件を理由に、業務停止の処分を受けたGTO。戦いの傷痕は深く、ESメンバーも壊滅状態だった。初めて直面した仲間の死に、消沈するアスクールとク・フィーユ。2人を元気づけようと、ディアが奮闘する。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-18","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fUpdo5oNiwI3gd08pjEbBOANYqk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fUpdo5oNiwI3gd08pjEbBOANYqk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"880052","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Gソサエティのリトゥーシャが、祖母の見舞いに病院を訪れた。シャドウワーカーに選ばれたことを喜ぶ祖母に対し、不満を打ち明けるリトゥーシャ。実はスパイを使って、ほかの2組の動向を探ってみたというのだが……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2009-12-25","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oiLpHtllLAkRG2Q28KRjaq3gZZG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oiLpHtllLAkRG2Q28KRjaq3gZZG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"880053","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"25年前に起きた、銀河存亡にまつわる大事件。GOTTは全兵力を以て戦い、からくも勝利した。アスクールたち3人は、事件の場所｢時間の凍りついた空間｣を訪れる。そこで待つのは、意外な人物との出会いであった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-08","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gLkAVBAH9OlKFPR3DSo7PxCCNWc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gLkAVBAH9OlKFPR3DSo7PxCCNWc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"880054","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"さらわれた元ノーブルズの令嬢たちを救出せよ!アスクール、ク・フィーユ、ディアが水着姿で潜入捜査!?アリサとベルまで現れて、ハイクラスなリゾート惑星をみんなでエンジョイしてしまう。特務の行方は……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-15","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/145m529YdSnMSh4yguGFqZYGypw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/145m529YdSnMSh4yguGFqZYGypw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"880055","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"人知れずク・フィーユの身体に異変が――!!｢記憶力よし子ちゃん｣なはずの彼女に、記憶の欠損が生じていたのだ。過去の記憶を確かめようと彼女は、アスクールと初めて出逢った惑星ニエトスでの特務に想いをはせる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r5Gxge7c7MbY4VtYWO5rDhUP9Uk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r5Gxge7c7MbY4VtYWO5rDhUP9Uk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"880057","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"今日で3日連続遅刻のアスクール。隣に住むク・フィーユは、呆れるばかりである。体育の授業はプール。学食での楽しい昼食。そして放課後は、演劇部の優しい先輩たちに見守られて、劇のお稽古。楽しい学園生活は続くが……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xMhBYOHAJ1SCYAY7O2cGqbsTgar.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xMhBYOHAJ1SCYAY7O2cGqbsTgar.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"880056","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Gソサエティを脱走したサフィルが、GTOに保護を求めてきた。その真偽を確かめるべく、アスクールたちは彼女の待つ惑星グラキエスへと向かった。はたして本当に、彼女はガクトエルを裏切ったのだろうか……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t7AvFcCcvdiwxo4VUamm5YDvEXh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t7AvFcCcvdiwxo4VUamm5YDvEXh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"880058","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Gソサエティに囚われたク・フィーユ。彼女の記憶は全て失われ、自分の名前すら思い出すことができない。唯一憶えているのは、｢アスクール｣という言葉だけ。そんな状態のク・フィーユにガクトエルは……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-12","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nQ4KzFMnxc2zTZPEw4aaVB8aVgB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nQ4KzFMnxc2zTZPEw4aaVB8aVgB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"880059","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ガクトエルの妹になったク・フィーユ。面白くないのはリトゥーシャである。そこでク・フィーユにあの手この手で悪戯を仕掛けるのだが……。一方アスクールは、アーカイブでク・フィーユの記録と対面していた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/x5E8asu6HDL74UHSzprGnIEyWbp.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x5E8asu6HDL74UHSzprGnIEyWbp.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"880060","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"GTO本局を襲う｢ガクトエルの妹姫｣ク・フィーユ。パートナーの変化にとまどいながらも彼女を傷つけまいと、アスクールは反撃することができない。このまま本当にク・フィーユは敵になってしまうのか!?","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-26","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dT2ulYSdVJToBmUUtPUJlWjZZa1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dT2ulYSdVJToBmUUtPUJlWjZZa1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"880061","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"祖母の病院にてリトゥーシャは、ク・フィーユとガクトエルを巡って口論になってしまった。ガクトエルを兄と慕いパートナーだと信じて疑わないク・フィーユ。リトゥーシャはいらだちのあまり、真実を暴露してしまう。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-03-05","language":"it-IT"},"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fkBGGi6uLh4KQGw2zKyeL9B1UfK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fkBGGi6uLh4KQGw2zKyeL9B1UfK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42418/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"880062","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"エルデ・メテオールがワープを開始した。アスクールとディアは居住区に閉じこめられてしまう。ガクトエルの本当の目的は妹・アスクールを手に入れることなのだ…。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{